<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic EPS view upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic EPS view upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial said it raised the rating on LSI Logic Corp to short-term buy from hold, and kept the long-term rating at hold.</p>
<p>-- raised the earnings estimates to $1.39 per share from $1.28 for 1997, and to $1.75 from $1.63 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $42. Shares rose one to 35.</p>
</text>
